{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\MediaEmbeddingConnector\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "namespace-mismatch",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/ImageEmbeddingBatchService.php:380 OCA\\MediaEmbeddingConnector\\Service\\ProcessIndexJobPolicy, by its path OCA\\MediaEmbeddingConnector\\Service\\ImageEmbeddingBatchService"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 class in lib/ whose name does not follow PSR-4 below OCA\\MediaEmbeddingConnector, the namespace the server derives from <namespace> of info.xml. The loader of the server does not find such a class.",
        "  lib/Service/ImageEmbeddingBatchService.php:380 OCA\\MediaEmbeddingConnector\\Service\\ProcessIndexJobPolicy, by its path OCA\\MediaEmbeddingConnector\\Service\\ImageEmbeddingBatchService"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "vimeo/psalm, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/UninstallCleanup.php:73 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app.",
        "lib/Service/SearchPluginDetector.php:34 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 32 to 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Migration/UninstallCleanup.php:73 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app.",
        "  lib/Service/SearchPluginDetector.php:34 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone"
      ]
    },
